This is an unofficial fan-made mod for GTFO. It is not made, endorsed or supported by 10 Chambers Collective.
GTFO and its game data belong to their owners; no file taken from the game is included in this package.

The package has three parts, each in its own folder: Carrier (the call-in platform), Arsenal (supply pods, turrets, strikes and
heavy weapons) and Frames (the exosuits). The files named below are in the part's folder.

